# The YAML layer's results for the yamltest corpus, recorded with
# go.yaml.in/yaml/v3. Regenerate with -update only when the YAML module is
# meant to change, and review every changed line (docs/ARCHIVE.md, 2026-11-08).

== base
OK {"k":"a"}

== unknown key
OK {"k":"a","zzz_unknown":int(1)}

== two unknown keys
OK {"k":"a","zzz_one":int(1),"zzz_two":int(2)}

== unknown key in a mapping
OK {"m":{"x":"a","zzz_unknown":int(1)}}

== duplicate key
ERR "yaml: unmarshal errors:\n  line 2: mapping key \"k\" already defined at line 1"

== duplicate key quoted
ERR "yaml: unmarshal errors:\n  line 2: mapping key \"k\" already defined at line 1"

== duplicate key in a mapping
ERR "yaml: unmarshal errors:\n  line 1: mapping key \"x\" already defined at line 1"

